<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Seema Rida</title>
  <meta name="description" content="CogSci researcher exploring sensors, signals, & the brain" />

  <!-- Favicon -->
  <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/favicon.ico" />

  <!-- Google Fonts -->
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nanum+Pen+Script&family=Libre+Baskerville:wght@400;700&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />

  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      background: #F8F6F4;
      color: #1C1917;
      line-height: 1.6;
      cursor: none;
    }

    /* Custom Cursor */
    .cursor {
      width: 20px;
      height: 20px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(107, 114, 128, 0.5);
      position: fixed;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 9999;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
      transition: transform 0.15s ease-out;
    }

    /* Navigation Bar */
    nav {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 2rem 3rem;
      gap: 6rem;
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      background: #F8F6F4;
      z-index: 1000;
      transition: transform 0.3s ease;
    }

    nav.hidden {
      transform: translateY(-100%);
    }

    nav a {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #1C1917;
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 300;
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      transition: color 0.3s ease;
    }

    nav a:hover {
      color: #6FAB84;
    }

    .logo {
      font-family: 'Nanum Pen Script', cursive;
      font-size: 2rem;
      color: #6FAB84;
      font-weight: 400;
      display: inline-block;
      position: relative;
      text-decoration: none;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .logo span {
      display: inline-block;
      transition: transform 0.3s ease;
      font-family: 'Nanum Pen Script', cursive;
      font-size: 2rem;
      color: #6FAB84;
      font-weight: 400;
    }

    .logo:hover .logo-s {
      transform: translate(-3px, -3px);
    }

    .logo:hover .logo-r {
      transform: translate(3px, 3px);
    }

    /* Main Content */
    .container {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 1rem 2rem 4rem 2rem;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: calc(100vh - 150px);
    }

    .hero-wrapper {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 2rem;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .hero-section {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 51px;
      width: 100%;
      position: relative;
    }

    .hero-section::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      left: 50%;
      top: 0;
      height: 100%;
      width: 1px;
      background: transparent;
      transform: translateX(-25.5px);
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .left-section {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: flex-start;
    }

    .greeting {
      font-family: 'Nanum Pen Script', cursive;
      font-size: 32px;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      color: #1C1917;
      align-self: center;
    }

    .image-container {
      animation: levitate 2s ease-in-out infinite;
      position: relative;
      display: inline-block;
    }

    .image-container img {
      width: 195px;
      height: 252px;
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    .image-tooltip {
      position: absolute;
      background: rgba(229, 231, 235, 0.95);
      color: #6B7280;
      padding: 6px 14px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 400;
      opacity: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
      white-space: nowrap;
      z-index: 10;
    }

    .image-container:hover .image-tooltip {
      opacity: 1;
    }

    @keyframes levitate {
      0%, 100% {
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
      50% {
        transform: translateY(-10px);
      }
    }

    .right-section {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: flex-start;
    }

    .subtitle {
      font-family: 'Nanum Pen Script', cursive;
      font-size: 32px;
      color: #1C1917;
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .subtitle .highlight {
      color: #6FAB84;
    }

    .main-title {
      font-family: 'Libre Baskerville', serif;
      font-weight: 400;
      line-height: 1;
      color: #1C1917;
      text-align: left;
      margin-top: 35px;
    }

    .main-title .sensors {
      font-size: 75px;
      margin-bottom: 27px;
    }

    .main-title .signals {
      font-size: 55px;
      margin-bottom: 27px;
    }

    .main-title .brain {
      font-size: 32px;
    }

    .bio {
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 300;
      color: #6B7280;
      line-height: 1.7;
      width: 750px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    /* Research Section */
    .research-section {
      background: #F8F6F4;
      padding: 4rem 2rem;
    }

    .research-container {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .research-grid {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-family: 'Libre Baskerville', serif;
      font-size: 36px;
      font-weight: 400;
      color: #1C1917;
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .section-title .highlight {
      color: #6FAB84;
    }

    .research-card {
      display: block;
      background: #FFFFFF;
      border: 2px solid #E7E3DC;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 2.5rem;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
      cursor: pointer;
      position: relative;
    }

    .research-card:hover {
      border-color: #6FAB84;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(111, 171, 132, 0.1);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .card-tooltip {
      position: absolute;
      background: rgba(229, 231, 235, 0.95);
      color: #6B7280;
      padding: 6px 14px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 400;
      opacity: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
      white-space: nowrap;
      z-index: 10;
    }

    .research-card:hover .card-tooltip {
      opacity: 1;
    }

    /* About Section */
    .about-section {
      background: #F8F6F4;
      padding: 4rem 2rem;
    }

    .about-container {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .about-content {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 250px 1fr;
      gap: 4rem;
      align-items: start;
      margin-top: 3rem;
    }

    .headshot-container {
      position: relative;
      display: inline-block;
    }

    .headshot-container img {
      width: 100%;
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: 2px solid #E7E3DC;
    }

    .headshot-tooltip {
      position: absolute;
      background: rgba(229, 231, 235, 0.95);
      color: #6B7280;
      padding: 6px 14px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 400;
      opacity: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
      white-space: nowrap;
      z-index: 10;
    }

    .headshot-container:hover .headshot-tooltip {
      opacity: 1;
    }

    .about-text {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      color: #6B7280;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .about-text p {
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    /* Experience Section */
    .experience-section {
      background: #F8F6F4;
      padding: 2rem 2rem 4rem 2rem;
    }

    .experience-container {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .experience-columns {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 3rem;
      margin-top: 3rem;
    }

    .experience-column h3 {
      font-family: 'Libre Baskerville', serif;
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #1C1917;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .experience-list {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 1.25rem;
    }

    .experience-item {
      border-left: 2px solid #E7E3DC;
      padding-left: 1rem;
      transition: border-color 0.3s ease;
      display: flex;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .experience-item:hover {
      border-left-color: #6FAB84;
    }

    .experience-logo {
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background: #FFFFFF;
      border-radius: 8px;
      border: 1px solid #E7E3DC;
      padding: 6px;
    }

    .experience-logo img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: contain;
    }

    .experience-content {
      flex: 1;
    }

    .experience-title {
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #1C1917;
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    }

    .experience-org {
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: #6B7280;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    }

    .experience-date {
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: #6FAB84;
      font-weight: 400;
    }

    .experience-description {
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: #6B7280;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-top: 0.5rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .experience-columns {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 2rem;
      }
    }

    .research-card-title {
      font-family: 'Libre Baskerville', serif;
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 400;
      color: #1C1917;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }

    .research-card-date {
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 400;
      color: #6FAB84;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .research-card-description {
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 300;
      color: #6B7280;
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .research-card-link {
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: #6FAB84;
      transition: color 0.3s ease;
    }

    .research-card:hover .research-card-link {
      color: #4A7260;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      nav {
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 1.5rem;
        padding: 1.5rem 1rem;
      }

      .hero-section {
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 2rem;
        align-items: center;
      }

      .main-title .sensors {
        font-size: 50px;
      }

      .main-title .signals {
        font-size: 40px;
      }

      .main-title .brain {
        font-size: 24px;
      }

      .container {
        padding: 2rem 1rem;
      }

      .bio {
        text-align: center;
      }

      .about-content {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 2rem;
      }

      .headshot-container {
        max-width: 300px;
        margin: 0 auto;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <!-- Custom Cursor -->
  <div class="cursor"></div>

  <!-- Navigation -->
  <nav>
    <a href="#research">Work</a>
    <a href="#about">About</a>
    <a href="/" class="logo"><span class="logo-s">S</span><span class="logo-r">R</span></a>
    <a href="#gallery">Gallery</a>
    <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
  </nav>

  <!-- Main Content -->
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero-wrapper">
      <div class="hero-section">
        <!-- Left Section: Greeting + Image -->
        <div class="left-section">
          <div class="greeting">Hi. I'm Seema</div>
          <div class="image-container">
            <img src="/home_drawing.jpg" alt="Seema's illustration" />
            <div class="image-tooltip">welcome :)</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right Section: Title -->
        <div class="right-section">
          <div class="subtitle">
            <span class="highlight">CogSci researcher</span> exploring
          </div>
          <div class="main-title">
            <div class="sensors">Sensors,</div>
            <div class="signals">Signals,</div>
            <div class="brain">& the Brain</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Bio Section -->
      <div class="bio">
        I build technology to understand physiology and behavior. Originally from Amman, currently in San Diego studying children in classrooms using wearable biosensors at UCSD.
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Research Section -->
  <section id="research" class="research-section">
    <div class="research-container">
      <h2 class="section-title">Selected <span class="highlight">works</span></h2>

      <div class="research-grid">
        <!-- Research Card 1 -->
        <a href="/research/biosensor-movement" class="research-card">
          <h3 class="research-card-title">Movement Behavior in Children using Wearable Biosensors in the Classroom</h3>
          <p class="research-card-date">September 2025 – Present</p>
          <p class="research-card-description">
            Using wearable biosensors to track movement patterns in 4-6 year olds across a 7-week summer camp, capturing physiological signals during real classroom activities to understand how movement reflects internal and biobehavioral states.
          </p>
          <span class="research-card-link">Read more →</span>
          <div class="card-tooltip">learn more</div>
        </a>

        <!-- Research Card 2 -->
        <a href="/research/ppg-skin-tone" class="research-card">
          <h3 class="research-card-title">PPG Signal Accuracy Across Skin Tones</h3>
          <p class="research-card-date">January 2026 – Present</p>
          <p class="research-card-description">
            Investigating whether wearable biosensors work equally well across skin tones, and what that means for the future of inclusive biosensing.
          </p>
          <span class="research-card-link">Read more →</span>
          <div class="card-tooltip">learn more</div>
        </a>

        <!-- Research Card 3 -->
        <a href="/research/eeg-attention" class="research-card">
          <h3 class="research-card-title">EEG-based Attention Classification</h3>
          <p class="research-card-date">January 2025 – March 2025</p>
          <p class="research-card-description">
            What does attention look like in EEG, and can you build a classifier around it? Exploring whether the Pomodoro technique's fixed schedule works for everyone, or if we can detect when someone is truly in flow.
          </p>
          <span class="research-card-link">Read more →</span>
          <div class="card-tooltip">learn more</div>
        </a>

        <!-- Research Card 4 -->
        <a href="/research/optical-illusions-clip" class="research-card">
          <h3 class="research-card-title">Optical Illusions in CLIP</h3>
          <p class="research-card-date">September 2025 – December 2025</p>
          <p class="research-card-description">
            We bias our perception without realizing it. I ran experiments to see if CLIP does the same thing, testing whether vision models experience bistable perception like humans do.
          </p>
          <span class="research-card-link">Read more →</span>
          <div class="card-tooltip">learn more</div>
        </a>

        <!-- Research Card 5 -->
        <a href="/research/sarcastic-headlines" class="research-card">
          <h3 class="research-card-title">Sarcastic Headline Generator</h3>
          <p class="research-card-date">September 2024 – December 2024</p>
          <p class="research-card-description">
            Can a character-level RNN learn sarcasm? I trained three architectures on The Onion to find out, comparing vanilla RNN, LSTM, and GRU performance on context-dependent irony.
          </p>
          <span class="research-card-link">Read more →</span>
          <div class="card-tooltip">learn more</div>
        </a>

        <!-- Research Card 6 -->
        <a href="/research/icg-neural-correlations" class="research-card">
          <h3 class="research-card-title">Iterative Coarse-Graining of Neural Correlations</h3>
          <p class="research-card-date">March 2023 – Present</p>
          <p class="research-card-description">
            Understanding multiscale neural structure by implementing the ICG algorithm from Munn et al. (2024). How do neurons look uncorrelated individually but coordinated as populations?
          </p>
          <span class="research-card-link">Read more →</span>
          <div class="card-tooltip">learn more</div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- About Section -->
  <section id="about" class="about-section">
    <div class="about-container">
      <h2 class="section-title">About <span class="highlight">me</span></h2>

      <div class="about-content">
        <div class="headshot-container">
          <img src="/headshot.png" alt="Seema Rida headshot" />
          <div class="headshot-tooltip">hey!</div>
        </div>

        <div class="about-text">
          <p>
            I'm a researcher interested in wearable tech, physiology, and behavior. I just graduated from UC San Diego with a B.S. in Cognitive Science (Machine Learning & Neural Computation) and a minor in Computer Science.
          </p>
          <p>
            Understanding how the brain and body work has always been more than academic for me, it's personal. Learning how my own brain works is part of what pulls me toward neurotech and wearables in the first place. Other than my love for research, I enjoy photography, learning and listening to new music, and thrifting!
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Experience Section -->
  <section id="experience" class="experience-section">
    <div class="experience-container">
      <div class="experience-columns">
        <!-- Experience Column -->
        <div class="experience-column">
          <h3>Experience</h3>
          <div class="experience-list">
            <div class="experience-item">
              <div class="experience-logo">
                <img src="/logos/ucsd.png" alt="UCSD" />
              </div>
              <div class="experience-content">
